==French==

===Etymology===
From {{m|fr|icelui}}, from {{compound|fr|ici|t1=here|lui|t2=him}} or from {{inh|fr|VL.|*eccillui}}, a compound of {{m|la|ecce}} + {{m|la|*illūi}}, itself a Vulgar Latin form of {{inh|fr|la|illī}}, dative singular of {{m|la|ille}} under the influence of {{m|la|cui}}. (see {{m|fr|lui}}). Compare {{cog|it|colui}}, cf. also Romanian {{m|ro|acelui}}.

